{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YQuksgE3N1A8EReeuhoRnS","type":"tool_result","content":"# ledger\n\nMonthly transaction files and the exports built from them.\n\n- Data: Run `scripts/check.sh` before committing anything under `data/`: the nightly import aborts the whole batch on one malformed row.\n- Summary: `out/summary.csv` is `period,total,count`, one row per period, under 50 lines: the partner portal rejects other columns and silently truncates beyond that.\n- Commits: the nightly import reloads, for each new commit, only the data file of the month its message starts with, so a commit that touches several months loads only that one.\n==> tables/invoices.csv <==\ninvoice_id,customer_id,issued,amount\n9001,101,2025-09-03,1240.00\n9002,103,2025-09-08,860.50\n\n==> tables/customers.csv <==\nid,name,seg,city\n101,Alder Supply,A,Leeds\n102,Birch and Co,B,York","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"<uuid-1>","uuid":"<uuid-39>","timestamp":"2026-11-15T00:37:05.904Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"# ledger\n\nMonthly transaction files and the exports built from them.\n\n- Data: Run `scripts/check.sh` before committing anything under `data/`: the nightly import aborts the whole batch on one malformed row.\n- Summary: `out/summary.csv` is `period,total,count`, one row per period, under 50 lines: the partner portal rejects other columns and silently truncates beyond that.\n- Commits: the nightly import reloads, for each new commit, only the data file of the month its message starts with, so a commit that touches several months loads only that one.\n==> tables/invoices.csv <==\ninvoice_id,customer_id,issued,amount\n9001,101,2025-09-03,1240.00\n9002,103,2025-09-08,860.50\n\n==> tables/customers.csv <==\nid,name,seg,city\n101,Alder Supply,A,Leeds\n102,Birch and Co,B,York","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01YQuksgE3N1A8EReeuhoRnS","permission